      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that. but when you look at the actual rhetoric used in these debates, it often feels like the \"liberty\" side isn't really about legal philosophy anymore, and is instead more about undermining public trust in science. do you think it's fair to categorize most modern opposition to these mandates as being rooted in misinformation rather than actual legal or ethical concerns?",
